+
+- [ ] P006: 补充视觉回归与交互验证 <!-- scope: test/widgets/editor_golden_test.dart,test/widgets/wenz_rich_text_editor_test.dart,test/widgets/slash_menu_overlay_test.dart,docs/plan/plan_feedback_8_20260626-025328.md -->
+  - 验收要点：新增或更新 golden 覆盖块工具栏右上角定位、简约图标、菜单 popup 样式和代码块深色背景选区效果。
